WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Don't worry. I'm here. No one can treat you badly.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
I will make you the happiest man in the world

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,000
The rest has just begun, guarding unknown resources like Baoxing

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Whether it’s wealth or space exploration, the future is limitless

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Tonight is just the starting point

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:21,070
Why panic? The worst thing is to drive that Porsche to school.

7
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,470
Just step on the accelerator and you'll be there in ten minutes

8
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:25,470
You're still staying in bed. You don't get up to have breakfast.

9
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:26,470
There's no takeout here

10
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:29,470
You go first and I'll deal with two of you later.

11
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:32,470
I have to go into Daqing Mountain to search for treasure. It will take a few days to lose it.

12
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:35,470
Went on a treasure hunt again. What treasures could there be in that barren mountain of Daqing Mountain?

13
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:37,470
Just because others can't find it doesn't mean I can't find it

14
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:40,470
How can I make hundreds of millions or even billions on this trip?

15
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:43,470
Just brag. I'll cook you a bowl of noodles before leaving.

16
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,470
The noodles are still hot. Eat quickly. Don't let it get cold.

17
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:52,050
What's a billion?
